    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Revolving objective turret with three separate objectives, rack-and-pinion focus wheels, stage clips, sub-stage condenser and tilting mirror are all resolved as distinct parts. Brass, black enamel and ground glass read as three convincing materials in every orbit. Top and bottom views confirm a properly closed cast base. 20.6k tris.",
    "limitations": [
      "Optics are opaque in the inspection render; enable transmission for the eyepiece and mirror.",
      "Focus and turret are modelled in fixed positions with no rig."
    ],
